#EXTM3U url-tvg="http://127.0.0.1:9/qa-src-a.xml"
# QA fixture: source A for the Sources scenarios (docs/QA-SOURCES.md, section 8 "Fixture catalogue").
#  - 8 channels in 3 groups (Alpha News, Alpha Sports, Alpha Kids); the probe result line must read "8 channels in 3 groups"
#  - every stream URL points at 127.0.0.1:8765, the harness server's own port, where no such path is served (a 404): on
#    loopback a channel is kept only on its playlist's own host AND port (D-SINK-57), so on any other port all 8 are
#    skipped and the playlist reads as empty (F-HARNESS-79). Nothing is ever fetched from the network
#  - t:qa.shared is also in qa-src-b.m3u under another group: a favorite on it survives a switch (SR9, D14)
#  - "Alpha Kids Two" has no tvg-id, so its id is n:4c58dcba (its name's), in this source only; the v1 fixtures
#    hold it under the first scheme's id, u:<fnv1a32 of its URL> = u:3a0fe282, which a fetch moves onto the current one
#  - the url-tvg hint points at the discard port, 127.0.0.1:9: another port than the playlist's, so it is never fetched
#  - served by the harness as http://127.0.0.1:8765/qa-src-a.m3u -> source key 584a58e5; as a path the key depends on the path
#EXTINF:-1 tvg-id="qa.a.news1" tvg-name="Alpha News One" group-title="Alpha News",Alpha News One
http://127.0.0.1:8765/alpha/news1.m3u8
#EXTINF:-1 tvg-id="qa.a.news2" group-title="Alpha News",Alpha News Two
http://127.0.0.1:8765/alpha/news2.m3u8
#EXTINF:-1 tvg-id="qa.shared" group-title="Alpha News",Shared Channel
http://127.0.0.1:8765/alpha/shared.m3u8
#EXTINF:-1 tvg-id="qa.a.sport1" group-title="Alpha Sports",Alpha Sports One
http://127.0.0.1:8765/alpha/sport1.m3u8
#EXTINF:-1 tvg-id="qa.a.sport2" group-title="Alpha Sports",Alpha Sports Two
http://127.0.0.1:8765/alpha/sport2.m3u8
#EXTINF:-1 tvg-id="qa.a.kids1" group-title="Alpha Kids",Alpha Kids One
http://127.0.0.1:8765/alpha/kids1.m3u8
#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Alpha Kids",Alpha Kids Two
http://127.0.0.1:8765/alpha/kids2.m3u8
#EXTINF:-1 tvg-id="qa.a.kids3" group-title="Alpha Kids",Alpha Kids Three
